    "| **2. Feature Engineering & Preparation** | Proper categorical encoding, feature scaling, feature selection/creation, and train-test split. | **3.0 pts** | | |\n",
    "| **3. Model Building & Evaluation** | Implementation of baseline & advanced models, performance metric evaluation, and model comparison. | **3.0 pts** | | |\n",
