      "text/plain": "           Dataset  TrainClass0  ...  BalancedWeight1  NegativePositiveRatio\n0  keep_duplicates        83137  ...         4.578542               8.157084\n1    no_duplicates        72104  ...         4.050522               7.101044\n\n[2 rows x 6 columns]",
